&lt;li&gt;Treat CI like SREs treat prod, making sure our pipelines are green and fast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare, run, and finish complex migrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute back to the Bazel ecosystem, upstreaming fixes and shaping features we depend on.&lt;/li&gt;
